#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:18
msgid ""
"Helikodu is an audio player and music library manager for your own music, "
"kept on your own computer. It works entirely offline: it never connects to "
"the internet and sends no telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:24
msgid ""
"Plays practically every audio format, including the sound track of video "
"files"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:25
msgid ""
"Gapless playback, bit-perfect output where the hardware allows it, and "
"ReplayGain 2.0 loudness normalization"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:26
msgid ""
"Choose the sound system, the output device and the mode, or switch them "
"while playing"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:27
msgid ""
"A library built for large collections, with fast search and play statistics"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.sorrelfox.Helikodu.metainfo.xml:28
msgid ""
"Media controls, media keys and notifications on GNOME, KDE Plasma and other "
"desktops"
msgstr ""

